{"words": [{"text": "وَإِن", "translation": "And if"}, {"text": "كُنتُمْ", "translation": "you are"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "رَيْبٍۢ", "translation": "doubt"}, {"text": "مِّمَّا", "translation": "about what"}, {"text": "نَزَّلْنَا", "translation": "We have revealed"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "عَبْدِنَا", "translation": "Our slave"}, {"text": "فَأْتُوا۟", "translation": "then produce"}, {"text": "بِسُورَةٍۢ", "translation": "a chapter"}, {"text": "مِّن", "translation": "[of]"}, {"text": "مِّثْلِهِۦ", "translation": "like it"}, {"text": "وَٱدْعُوا۟", "translation": "and call"}, {"text": "شُهَدَآءَكُم", "translation": "your witnesses"}, {"text": "مِّن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "دُونِ", "translation": "other than"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "إِن", "translation": "if"}, {"text": "كُنتُمْ", "translation": "you are"}, {"text": "صَـٰدِقِينَ", "translation": "truthful"}], "sahih": "And if you are in doubt about what We have sent down [i.e., the Qur’ān] upon Our Servant [i.e., Prophet Muḥammad (ﷺ)], then produce a sūrah the like thereof and call upon your witnesses [i.e., supporters] other than Allāh, if you should be truthful."}